default reject einops._backends.HashableTuple.__len__: no HashableTuple is measured or tested for truth at this site; only TensorflowBackend.shape and TFKerasBackend.shape make one, and the len() sites on a backend shape (reduce, parse_shape, _enumerate_directions, pack, unpack) accept the candidate explicitly
default reject einops._backends.UnknownSize.__eq__: no operand of this comparison, `in` test, list search, set construction or dict key lookup is an UnknownSize; UnknownSize objects exist only as elements of the eager TensorflowBackend.shape tuples (and of what parse_shape and pack copy out of them), and the sites that compare those elements accept the candidate explicitly
